SUMMARY:Review LinkedIn post: UA Online PMDay 2027 Winter / announcement
DESCRIPTION:Private preparation reminder. Review current programme\, event 
 facts\, copy and visual before posting.\n\nState: authored. Timezone: Euro
 pe/Warsaw.\n\nPurpose: Confirm participation\, date\, online format and re
 gistration.\n\nI’ll be speaking at UA Online PMDay 2027 Winter on 30 Jan
 uary.\n\nMy work explores two connected shifts: how AI changes software de
 livery\, and what happens when the products we build begin to exercise jud
 gment themselves.\n\nBoth raise questions about how we organize work\, ver
 ify outcomes and take responsibility for decisions.\n\nI’m glad to be re
 turning to the PMDay community. I’ll share the session title and details
  once confirmed.\n\n📅 30 January 2027\n🌐 Online\n\nEvent details and
  registration:\nhttps://pmday.org/online\n\n#PMDay #SoftwareDelivery #AIGo
 vernance\n\n\nEvent details and registration: https://pmday.org/online\n\n
 Repository inputs: drafts/events/pmday-winter-2027/plan.json\n\nSource pla
 n: https://github.com/oborskyivitalii/oborskyivitalii/blob/d1b777743db582a
 1675e7f46f856d2be8efc4e61/drafts/events/pmday-winter-2027/plan.json\n\nCop
 y: https://github.com/oborskyivitalii/oborskyivitalii/blob/d1b777743db582a
 1675e7f46f856d2be8efc4e61/drafts/events/pmday-winter-2027/posts/announceme
 nt.en.md\n\nKit files: announcement.en.md and announcement.png when author
 ed/rendered.\n\nFile export does not schedule LinkedIn or write to a calen
 dar account.
